    "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\"><strong>·1月更新内容前瞻</strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"317\" title=\"1 封面.png\" alt=\"1 封面.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20251029/8b509bf5fd32de5bf26b93dcf4cef0e7.png\"/></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSansCN-Medium\"><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><span style=\"background-color:#1f1f1f\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游览者列表</span></strong></span></span></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"318\" title=\"2 月度.png\" alt=\"2 月度.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20251029/762278aeab25097366616618064cffb4.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">界园游客 余</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">世间种种滋味，他已悉数尝过。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·游园纪念</span></strong></span></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"319\" title=\"3 奖励.png\" alt=\"3 奖励.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/pic/20251029/4b7179a4eb14a2ca1093d58a7e933fa5.png\"/></div><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">游园纪念添加内容</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">游园纪念的等级上限提升至</span><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">140</span></strong><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">。</span></span></p><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">1月稀有奖励 主题场景 游园</span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\">池平树古，不见描碑之人。桐间露落，方觉两别之怀。</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size:1.3125em\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bcf4ca\">·本月委托栏</span></strong></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">本月委托栏将会覆盖一批委托。委托更新后，上月的委托进度将不会被继承。</span></span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color:#be5d52\"><span style=\"color:#c6c6c6\"><span style=\"font-size:0.9375em\">您将获得可在本月使用的四次刷新未完成委托的机会。点击刷新后，即可重新获得同等级的委托。</span></span></span></p>",
